       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYROL.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  EMP-NAME       PIC X(20) VALUE "J. DEC ENGINEER".
       01  HOURS-WORKED   PIC 9(4)  VALUE 40.
       01  HOURLY-RATE    PIC 9(4)  VALUE 25.
       01  BONUS-AMT      PIC 9(4)  VALUE 200.
       01  GROSS-PAY      PIC 9(6)  VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LOGIC.
           DISPLAY "DEC PDP-11 COBOL-81 V2.4 PAYROLL SYSTEM".
           PERFORM CALC-PAY.
           DISPLAY "EMPLOYEE:  " EMP-NAME.
           DISPLAY "GROSS PAY: " GROSS-PAY.
           STOP RUN.
       CALC-PAY.
           MULTIPLY HOURS-WORKED BY HOURLY-RATE GIVING GROSS-PAY.
           ADD BONUS-AMT TO GROSS-PAY.
           EXIT.
